      },
      "content": "FRONT ENCLOSURE, REAR ENCLOSURE, OR MAIN",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0941",
      "reading_order": 1021,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 738.192,
        "r": 309.21889200000004,
        "b": 692.3030844297522
      },
      "content": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "level": 2,
      "role": "section"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0942",
      "reading_order": 1022,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 108.0,
        "t": 678.1227600000001,
        "r": 540.015,
        "b": 657.2275290491804
      },
      "content": "The recommended tools for this procedure are a #2 Phillips screwdriver, medium size flat blade screwdriver, and 3/16 nutdriver."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0943",
      "reading_order": 1023,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99999999999997,
        "t": 642.531696,
        "r": 539.9891040000009,
        "b": 609.3407163093623
      },
      "content": "Use  proper  ESD  grounding  techniques  when  handling  components.  Wear  an antistatic  wrist  strap  and  use  an  ESD-protected  workstation.  Store  PWAs  in antistatic bags before placing them on any surface."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0944",
      "reading_order": 1024,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99999999999997,
        "t": 594.124104,
        "r": 330.09604799999966,
        "b": 585.2286810491803
      },
      "content": "The replacement parts for this procedure are:"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0945",
      "reading_order": 1025,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.99971199999997,
        "t": 576.124392,
        "r": 330.27831599999973,
        "b": 469.3894480327866
      },
      "content": "Enclosure, Front Enclosure, Rear Chassis, Main Shoe, Front Enclosure Screw, 6-32 x 1/2, Pan Head, Phillips Screw, 6-32 x 2 1/2, Pan Head, Phillips Screw, 6-32 x 3 1/4, Pan Head, Phillips Washer, Lock, #6"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0946",
      "reading_order": 1026,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99999999999983,
        "t": 452.10545999999977,
        "r": 540.0070319999999,
        "b": 431.2102290491801
      },
      "content": "To replace the front enclosure, rear enclosure, or main chassis assembly, see Figure 7-7 , then proceed as follows:",
      "hyperlink_hint": true
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0947",
      "reading_order": 1027,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039599999984,
        "t": 416.1060359999998,
        "r": 444.23465999999905,
        "b": 407.2106130491801
      },
      "content": "Turn off the infuser and disconnect the device from AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0948",
      "reading_order": 1028,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039599999984,
        "t": 400.6859639999998,
        "r": 380.0474399999999,
        "b": 391.7905410491801
      },
      "content": "Remove the battery as described in Section 7.2.4 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0949",
      "reading_order": 1029,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58039599999984,
        "t": 385.2658919999998,
        "r": 539.9552399999994,
        "b": 364.9104930491801
      },
      "content": "Separate  the  front  enclosure,  rear  enclosure,  and  main  chassis  assembly as described in Section 7.2.8 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0950",
      "reading_order": 1030,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58139199999985,
        "t": 358.3858439999998,
        "r": 540.0229679999995,
        "b": 338.0304450491801
      },
      "content": "To replace the front enclosure, remove the gaskets described in Section 7.2.9.1 and Section 7.2.9.2 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0951",
      "reading_order": 1031,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58139199999985,
        "t": 331.5057959999998,
        "r": 540.0508559999994,
        "b": 311.1503970491801
      },
      "content": "To replace the rear enclosure,  remove  the  specific  components  described in Section 7.2.10 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0952",
      "reading_order": 1032,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58139199999985,
        "t": 304.56598799999983,
        "r": 540.0239639999992,
        "b": 284.27034904918014
      },
      "content": "To replace the main chassis assembly, remove the specific components described in Section 7.2.12 ."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0953",
      "reading_order": 1033,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58139199999985,
        "t": 277.68593999999985,
        "r": 540.1056360000002,
        "b": 257.39030104918015
      },
      "content": "Reassemble  the  front  enclosure,  rear  enclosure,  or  main  chassis  assembly components."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0954",
      "reading_order": 1034,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 253.62009999999998,
        "r": 540.0875760000007,
        "b": 212.62782104918028
      },
      "content": " Note: Assure the CPU/driver cable is positioned completely above and to the side of the battery enclosure prior to joining the rear enclosure to the main chassis."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0955",
      "reading_order": 1035,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58026399999997,
        "t": 201.48372399999994,
        "r": 540.0576959999986,
        "b": 181.18808504918036
      },
      "content": "Join the front enclosure, main chassis assembly, and rear enclosure in the exact reverse order of separation."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0956",
      "reading_order": 1036,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 125.58026399999997,
        "t": 174.60367599999995,
        "r": 420.4689720000001,
        "b": 165.70825304918037
      },
      "content": "Reinstall the battery and connect the device to AC power."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0957",
      "reading_order": 1037,
      "section": "7.2.9 CHASSIS REPLACEMENT",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 107.99986799999996,
        "t": 151.20365200000003,
        "r": 540.0875759999997,
        "b": 130.3084210491803
      },
      "content": "To verify successful front enclosure, rear enclosure, or main chassis replacement, perform the PVT in Section 5.2 ."
    }
  ],
